    {
        "id": 49,
        "raw": "[name=\"阿丽娜\"]  啊，早。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "阿丽娜",
        "content": "啊，早。"
    },
    {
        "id": 50,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"avg_npc_078\")]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_078.png"
    },
    {
        "id": 51,
        "raw": "[name=\"塔露拉\"]  现在出去会不会有些危险？",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "塔露拉",
        "content": "现在出去会不会有些危险？"
    },
    {
        "id": 52,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"avg_npc_079\",name2=\"avg_npc_078\",focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_079.png",
        "name2": "avg_npc_078",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 53,
        "raw": "[name=\"阿丽娜\"]  我问过战士们，纠察队应该都聚在西边的村子吧？前几天你们和他们的交流是不是被发现了？",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "阿丽娜",
        "content": "我问过战士们，纠察队应该都聚在西边的村子吧？前几天你们和他们的交流是不是被发现了？"
    },
    {
        "id": 54,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"avg_npc_079\",name2=\"avg_npc_078\",focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_079.png",
        "name2": "avg_npc_078",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 55,
        "raw": "[name=\"塔露拉\"]  有这个可能。所以，暂时别往西边去了。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "塔露拉",
        "content": "有这个可能。所以，暂时别往西边去了。"
    },
    {
        "id": 56,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"avg_npc_079\",name2=\"avg_npc_078\",focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_079.png",
        "name2": "avg_npc_078",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 57,
        "raw": "[name=\"阿丽娜\"]  我知道的，那东边这个村子，应该还是可以换些东西的。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "阿丽娜",
        "content": "我知道的，那东边这个村子，应该还是可以换些东西的。"
    },
    {
        "id": 58,
        "raw": "[name=\"阿丽娜\"]  哎呀，别太担心，我们以前遇到的情况可比这危险多了。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "阿丽娜",
        "content": "哎呀，别太担心，我们以前遇到的情况可比这危险多了。"
    },
    {
        "id": 59,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"avg_npc_079\",name2=\"avg_npc_078#2\",focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_079.png",
        "name2": "avg_npc_078#2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 60,
        "raw": "[name=\"塔露拉\"]  你准备去换些什么？",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "塔露拉",
        "content": "你准备去换些什么？"
    },
    {
        "id": 61,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"avg_npc_079\",name2=\"avg_npc_078#2\",focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_079.png",
        "name2": "avg_npc_078#2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 62,
        "raw": "[name=\"阿丽娜\"]  罐装水果和干蔬果。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "阿丽娜",
        "content": "罐装水果和干蔬果。"
    },
    {
        "id": 63,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"avg_npc_079\",name2=\"avg_npc_078#2\",focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_079.png",
        "name2": "avg_npc_078#2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 64,
        "raw": "[name=\"塔露拉\"]  ……好像不是特别重要的东西？",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "塔露拉",
        "content": "……好像不是特别重要的东西？"
    },
    {
        "id": 65,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"avg_npc_079\",name2=\"avg_npc_078#2\",focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_079.png",
        "name2": "avg_npc_078#2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 66,
        "raw": "[name=\"阿丽娜\"]  再这样下去战士们会得病的。你也多学点生活方面的常识吧……",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "阿丽娜",
        "content": "再这样下去战士们会得病的。你也多学点生活方面的常识吧……"
    },
    {
        "id": 67,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"avg_npc_079\",name2=\"avg_npc_078\",focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_079.png",
        "name2": "avg_npc_078",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 68,
        "raw": "[name=\"塔露拉\"]  填饱肚子都很困难了，有些东西大概真不是那么……",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "塔露拉",
        "content": "填饱肚子都很困难了，有些东西大概真不是那么……"
    },
    {
        "id": 69,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"avg_npc_079#5\",name2=\"avg_npc_078\",focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_079#5.png",
        "name2": "avg_npc_078",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 70,
        "raw": "[name=\"阿丽娜\"]  不对，塔露拉，这可不对。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "阿丽娜",
        "content": "不对，塔露拉，这可不对。"
    },
    {
        "id": 71,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"avg_npc_079#5\")]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_079#5.png"
    },
    {
        "id": 72,
        "raw": "[name=\"阿丽娜\"]  嗯哼，咳——",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "阿丽娜",
        "content": "嗯哼，咳——"
    },
    {
        "id": 73,
        "raw": "[name=\"阿丽娜\"]  “正因为我们有时候吃不饱也穿不暖，所以那些诗歌、音乐、果实、鲜花，对味觉、视觉和嗅觉、触觉的渴望，才是可贵的。”",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "阿丽娜",
        "content": "“正因为我们有时候吃不饱也穿不暖，所以那些诗歌、音乐、果实、鲜花，对味觉、视觉和嗅觉、触觉的渴望，才是可贵的。”"
    },
    {
        "id": 74,
        "raw": "[name=\"阿丽娜\"]  “就是这些东西提醒着我们，我们是在为了让所有人过上什么样的生活而奋斗的。”",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "阿丽娜",
        "content": "“就是这些东西提醒着我们，我们是在为了让所有人过上什么样的生活而奋斗的。”"
    },
    {
        "id": 75,
        "raw": "[name=\"阿丽娜\"]  健康的身体当然也是其中一部分。一点点蔬果就能让许多人都摆脱疾病了。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "阿丽娜",
        "content": "健康的身体当然也是其中一部分。一点点蔬果就能让许多人都摆脱疾病了。"
    },
    {
        "id": 76,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"avg_npc_079#5\",name2=\"avg_npc_078#2\",focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_079#5.png",
        "name2": "avg_npc_078#2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 77,
        "raw": "[name=\"塔露拉\"]  ……用我的说法反驳我，很狡诈。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "塔露拉",
        "content": "……用我的说法反驳我，很狡诈。"
    },
    {
        "id": 78,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"avg_npc_079#3\",name2=\"avg_npc_078#2\",focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_079#3.png",
        "name2": "avg_npc_078#2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 79,
        "raw": "[name=\"阿丽娜\"]  什么呀……狡诈是什么词儿啊，不应该哦塔露拉同学。请跟我说，聪——明——！",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "阿丽娜",
        "content": "什么呀……狡诈是什么词儿啊，不应该哦塔露拉同学。请跟我说，聪——明——！"
    },
    {
        "id": 80,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"avg_npc_079#3\",name2=\"avg_npc_078#2\",focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_079#3.png",
        "name2": "avg_npc_078#2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 81,
        "raw": "[name=\"塔露拉\"]  好好。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "塔露拉",
        "content": "好好。"
    },
    {
        "id": 82,
        "raw": "[name=\"塔露拉\"]  需要人保护你吗？",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "塔露拉",
        "content": "需要人保护你吗？"
    },
    {
        "id": 83,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"avg_npc_079\",name2=\"avg_npc_078#2\",focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_079.png",
        "name2": "avg_npc_078#2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 84,
        "raw": "[name=\"阿丽娜\"]  不太好。我又不是什么特别的感染者，因为我让我们暴露踪迹可不好。而且，我是比较容易隐藏自己身份的感染者，其他的战士们可不容易。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "阿丽娜",
        "content": "不太好。我又不是什么特别的感染者，因为我让我们暴露踪迹可不好。而且，我是比较容易隐藏自己身份的感染者，其他的战士们可不容易。"
    },
    {
        "id": 85,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"avg_npc_079\",name2=\"avg_npc_078\",focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_079.png",
        "name2": "avg_npc_078",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 86,
        "raw": "[name=\"塔露拉\"]  那注意安全。那些村民也没那么值得信任……出尔反尔的事情发生得多了去了。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "塔露拉",
        "content": "那注意安全。那些村民也没那么值得信任……出尔反尔的事情发生得多了去了。"
    },
    {
        "id": 87,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"avg_npc_079\",name2=\"avg_npc_078\",focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_079.png",
        "name2": "avg_npc_078",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 88,
        "raw": "[name=\"阿丽娜\"]  嗯，好。噢，我会多换点梨的。雪怪们会不会更喜欢苹果？",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "阿丽娜",
        "content": "嗯，好。噢，我会多换点梨的。雪怪们会不会更喜欢苹果？"
    },
    {
        "id": 89,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"avg_npc_079\",name2=\"avg_npc_078\",focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_079.png",
        "name2": "avg_npc_078",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 90,
        "raw": "[name=\"塔露拉\"]  他们好像更喜欢山莓……就别管他们了吧。他们找那些有自己那一套。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "塔露拉",
        "content": "他们好像更喜欢山莓……就别管他们了吧。他们找那些有自己那一套。"
    },
    {
        "id": 91,
        "raw": "[name=\"塔露拉\"]  我还有个会要开。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "塔露拉",
        "content": "我还有个会要开。"
    },
    {
        "id": 92,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"avg_npc_079\",name2=\"avg_npc_078\",focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_079.png",
        "name2": "avg_npc_078",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 93,
        "raw": "[name=\"阿丽娜\"]  好，那我走啦。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "阿丽娜",
        "content": "好，那我走啦。"
    },
    {
        "id": 94,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"avg_npc_078\")]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_078.png"
    },
    {
        "id": 95,
        "raw": "[name=\"塔露拉\"]  ——阿丽娜！",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "塔露拉",
        "content": "——阿丽娜！"
    },
    {
        "id": 96,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"avg_npc_079\",name2=\"avg_npc_078\",focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_079.png",
        "name2": "avg_npc_078",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 97,
        "raw": "[name=\"阿丽娜\"]  什么？",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "阿丽娜",
        "content": "什么？"
    },
    {
        "id": 98,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"avg_npc_079\",name2=\"avg_npc_078#2\",focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_079.png",
        "name2": "avg_npc_078#2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 99,
        "raw": "[name=\"塔露拉\"]  之后我准备组织一个感染者教育小组，你想当组长吗？",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "塔露拉",
        "content": "之后我准备组织一个感染者教育小组，你想当组长吗？"
    },
    {
        "id": 100,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"avg_npc_079\",name2=\"avg_npc_078#2\",focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_079.png",
        "name2": "avg_npc_078#2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 101,
        "raw": "[name=\"阿丽娜\"]  啊，我可以吗？",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "阿丽娜",
        "content": "啊，我可以吗？"
    },
    {
        "id": 102,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"avg_npc_079\",name2=\"avg_npc_078#2\",focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_079.png",
        "name2": "avg_npc_078#2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 103,
        "raw": "[name=\"塔露拉\"]  在那些不是战士的感染者里，你的名声可比我要好。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "塔露拉",
        "content": "在那些不是战士的感染者里，你的名声可比我要好。"
    },
    {
        "id": 104,
        "raw": "[name=\"塔露拉\"]  那时候也比较容易向大家介绍你了。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "塔露拉",
        "content": "那时候也比较容易向大家介绍你了。"
    },
    {
        "id": 105,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"avg_npc_079\",name2=\"avg_npc_078#2\",focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_079.png",
        "name2": "avg_npc_078#2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 106,
        "raw": "[name=\"阿丽娜\"]  我不是说……",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "阿丽娜",
        "content": "我不是说……"
    },
    {
        "id": 107,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"avg_npc_079\",name2=\"avg_npc_078#2\",focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_079.png",
        "name2": "avg_npc_078#2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 108,
        "raw": "[name=\"塔露拉\"]  知识的战士也是战士，阿丽娜。这点我会坚持。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "塔露拉",
        "content": "知识的战士也是战士，阿丽娜。这点我会坚持。"
    },
    {
        "id": 109,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"avg_npc_079\",name2=\"avg_npc_078#2\",focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_079.png",
        "name2": "avg_npc_078#2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 110,
        "raw": "[name=\"阿丽娜\"]  那……",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "阿丽娜",
        "content": "那……"
    },
    {
        "id": 111,
        "raw": "[name=\"阿丽娜\"]  看你安排吧。不会要写演讲辞吧？",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "阿丽娜",
        "content": "看你安排吧。不会要写演讲辞吧？"
    },
    {
        "id": 112,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"avg_npc_079\",name2=\"avg_npc_078#2\",focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_079.png",
        "name2": "avg_npc_078#2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 113,
        "raw": "[name=\"塔露拉\"]  啊，我仿佛已经听到掌声了。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "塔露拉",
        "content": "啊，我仿佛已经听到掌声了。"
    },
    {
        "id": 114,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"avg_npc_079#3\")]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_079#3.png"
    },
    {
        "id": 115,
        "raw": "[name=\"阿丽娜\"]  ……别揶揄我了。我去了。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "阿丽娜",
        "content": "……别揶揄我了。我去了。"
    },
